/- English proof (translation)
Establish an intermediate fact. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Prove the components needed by the constructor for the conclusion. Assume the hypotheses and unpack their components. Supply the required witnesses or components.

Assume the hypotheses and unpack their components. Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. Use the resulting assumption.

Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Normalize the expressions using the abelian group laws. Introduce a local definition for the expression. Establish an intermediate fact.

Assume the hypotheses and unpack their components. Supply the required witnesses or components. Establish an intermediate fact. By extensionality, compare the relevant components. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities.

Replace the relevant objects with their definitions. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. A detailed English derivation is pending.
